{"id":"u-83eef5b8-0c3c-4089-9709-a073e572c6be","src":"community","title":"PPLUL","author":"Caleb B.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/6woIj0-untitled-program","desc":"PPLUL — 10 WEEK WORKOUT PROGRAM\n\nPush • Pull • Legs • Upper • Lower\n\n10 weeks. 5 training days. One goal: build strength, build muscle, and become a stronger version of yourself.\n\nThis PPLUL program follows a five-day training split designed to target every major muscle group throughout the week. Focus on progressive overload, controlled reps, proper technique, and consistent effort.\n\nTHE SPLIT\n\n- Monday — Push\n- Tuesday — Pull\n- Wednesday — Legs\n- Thursday — Upper\n- Friday — Lower\n- Saturday & Sunday — Rest and recovery\n\nTHE MISSION\n\n- Build lean muscle and strength\n- Improve performance across all major lifts\n- Track your progress week by week\n- Master your technique\n- Stay consistent for all 10 weeks\n\nTHE RULES\nTrain with purpose. Keep your form strict. Recover properly. Aim to improve over time without sacrificing technique.\n\nNo shortcuts. No wasted reps. Just discipline and consistency.\n\n10 WEEKS. 5 DAYS. ONE MISSION.\n\nEarn your progress. Respect the work.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle","Athletics"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":30,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-18T03:35:24.117Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push","Pull","Leg","Upper","Lower"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pec Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Front Raise","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"V-Handle Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":20,"x":3}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hanging Knee Raise","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hanging Oblique Knee Raise","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Kelso Shrug (Chest Supported)","sets":[{"r